ÖA book of simple skills that can help us to interact with nature, achieve a deeper connection with it, and even step inside another dimension
"There are forces deep in everyone's subconscious that find a pure expression in the simplest of activities. This book explains why we should be taking the time to do them. It is born out of a wish to share our passion for our landscape and the contemplative, reflective pleasures and joys that were well-known to our grandparents, but which are in danger of being lost and forgotten. They will help us get back to a place where we all belong."
Through teaching such basic outdoor skills as making and flying a kite, tracking an animal, damming a stream, and lighting a fire, this book also teaches the reader valuable lessons about life. These exercises are intended to be not only of practical value but also techniques for meditation. They help the practitioner live in the moment and recover ancient insights and rhythms, while encouraging nature to reveal her secrets and treasures."â	
Ü	Ti tha ginotan an...
Ti tha ginotan an mia mera arkhizame na dekhomaste ena menuma apo ta' astra; Ena periploko, kodiko menuma pou mporei na ekrube te soteria tou kosmou mas e ten katastrophe mas.
Ksero, to proto tha etan kapoios na to upoklepsei kai na to magnetophonesei, to deutero kapoios allos na tou phortosei PhPA kai to trito kapoios na to anathesei se epitrope, alla den ennoousa auto, ennoousa, ti tha kaname pragmatika; Pos th' antidrousame sten proklese;
Alla o tropos pou antidra o anthropos se mia proklese apo to Agnosto einai parallela mia diadikasia toso exoterikes oso kai esoterikes anakalupses. Kathe bema pros ta exo einai parallela kai ena bema pros ta mesa. Prospathontas n' anakalupsei pos skephtetai o exogeinos, anakaluptei tautokhrona kai pos skephtetai o idios. An den to kanei auto, einai kati parapano apo mataio - einai skhedon san na to anathetei se epitrope. Blepete, anamesa sta kosmika kheile pou mas miloun kai sta anthropina autia pou akoune mesolaboun kati parapano apo ete photos - mesolabei o egkephalos mas. To problema edo einai monakha ti mas lene ta' astra alla kai ti periekhomeno dinei to mualo mas sto menuma..."ä
áO Nikolo Polo, pateras tou Marko Polo, apokaluptei epitelous ten istoria pou eikhe kratesei kruphe mia oloklere zoe - ten istoria tou AltaIr, enos apo tous pio dunamikous Asasinous tes adelphotetas.
O AltaIr xekina gia mia tromere apostole* mia apostole pou tha ton odegesei apo te mia akre ton Agion Topon os ten alle kai tha tou apokalupsei to pragmatiko noema tou Dogmatos ton Asasinon. Gia
na apodeixei ten aphosiose tou, o AltaIr kaleitai na antimetopisei thanasimous ekhthrous, mazi kai ton egete ton Naiton, Romper nte Sample.
Sto biblio existoreitai gia prote phora e zoe tou AltaIr: ena sunarpastiko taxidi pou allazei to rou tes istorias* e aenae makhe tou enantia ste sunomosia ton Naiton* mia tragike oikogeneiake zoe pou kobei ten anasa* kai e apolute prodosia enos paliou philou.
Basismeno sto best seller binteopaikhnidi ASSASSIN'S CREED (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"é
ãTwo months after the flashy and brilliant escape from the DARPA funded military think he used to call his home, slacker/genius Dr. David Loren has willingly returned to his lab to continue his work that he not long ago wished to be no part of. When a weapons designer loses his moral compass, who are the true victims of his creations?
Collects THINK TANK #4-8 and THINK TANK MILITARY DOSSIER #1"è
åO Phalk, opos kai o anagnostes, den mporei pote na einai sigouros mekhri to telos tou muthistorematos gia to an osa blepei, akouei kai mathainei einai aletheia e psema kai sukhna mesa sten istoria allazei gnome gia to ti einai pragmatiko kai ti pseutiko. An kai mikro se megethos, to muthistorema periekhei ousia kai idees pou alloi suggrapheis tha aneptussan se polles ekatontades selides. Opos panta, e le Gken okhi mono mas kanei na sumpaskhoume me tous eroes tes, alla kai na niothoume pos parakolouthoume mia pragmatike istoria kai okhi mia suggraphike epinoese.
E Pole ton Pseudaistheseon einai ena pragmatika klasiko kai axeperasto muthistorema."ì
êWhether fierce, cuddly, startling, mysterious, or some indefinable combination of all of the above, nocturnal animals never fail to fascinate. In Nocturne: Creatures of the Night, celebrated animal photographer Traer Scott takes the viewer on a journey through nighttime in the animal kingdom, revealing some of nature's most elusive creatures. Bats, big cats, flying squirrels, tarantula, owls, kangaroo mice, giant moths, sloth, several species of snakes, and a Madagascar hissing cockroach are only a few of the animals illuminated in these lushly detailed portraits. Seventy-five full-color photographs of forty different species are accompanied by informed but accessible descriptions of each animal's habits and habitats, and an introduction provides personal insight into how Scott captures her astonishing images. Nocturne is a compelling view of the rarely seen darkness dwellers who populate the night."ï
íTo biblio pou demosieuse o Le Corbusier to 1923 etan mia olokleromene ekphrase tes neoterikotetas kai apotelese pragmatiko stathmo gia ten arkhitektonike tou 20ou aiona. E rizospastike anazetese tou neou pneumatos aperripte to akademaiko parelthon, alla auto to neo pneuma sterizotan prokletika sten epanermeneia tou klasikou ideodous tou Parthenona mesa se ena aprosmeno periballon mekhanon (aeroplana, autokineta, ploia). Autes oi idees xeperasan to steno plaisio tes epokhes tous kai apotelesan pedio problematismou gia ten poreia tes sugkhrones arkhitektonikes mekhri tis meres mas. To biblio endiapherei eidikotera emas, tous Ellenes, mesa apo ten prospatheia pou ekhei kanei o suggrapheas na sundesei ta idanika tou parelthontos me tis pio exeligmenes ekphraseis tou tekhnologikou parontos. Einai metaphrasmeno se polles glosses kai e apousia tou apo ten ellenike bibliographia aphene mekhri semera ena keno."õ
òWhen Roger Deakin died in August 2006, his death was considered by many to be a great loss to literature. "Notes From Walnut Tree Farm" collects together the jottings, musings and observations with which he filled a series of notebooks for the last six years of his life. In this beautiful illustrated collection, descriptions of walks on Mellis Common and thoughts on the importance of nature sit side by side with memories of the past and musings about literature, while perfectly rendered observations of the tiny, missable visual details of everyday life are skilfully woven with a gentle, wise philosophy. Organized into twelve months of impressions, the notes reveal a passionate but gentle character and his extraordinary, restless curiosity. Capturing Deakin's unique turn of phrase and inspired use of language, and infused throughout with the magically meditative tranquility of Walnut Tree Farm, this is a charming introduction to one of the most important of modern nature writers, or the perfect follow-up to "Wildwood" and "Waterlog"."û
õGiorgos Mpalanos, H.P. Lovecraft, Clark Ashton Smith, Robert Bloch, Ramsey Campbell, Arthur Machen, T. Reimer, Brian Lumley, Robert Black, Robert E. Howard"°
ûEkhoun perasei ekatommuria khronia kai e Ge ekhei gerasei. Ta psela bouna tes ekhoun diabrothei kai ta potamia tes kuloun pia nothra anamesa se paraxena dentra me skourokhromo phulloma. O kokkinos elios rikhnei monakha ena thampo phos, eno oi nukhtes einai skoteines, aphou to pheggari ekhei khathei pro pollou apo to stereoma. Allokota plasmata kuklophoroun stis eremies tou kosmou kai oi elakhistoi anthropoi zoun se mikres apomonomenes koinotetes, perimenontas moirolatrika te stigme pou o elios tha sbesei buthizontas ton kosmo ston teleutaio aionio kheimona.
E mageia xanazei, kai oi ligostoi gnostes tes mporoun na allaxoun ten idia te phuse. Ena xorki, katallela eipomeno, mporei na pherei kapoion daimona mesa apo ta skotadia tou apeirou e na demiourgesei ena plasma aperigraptes omorphias."•
¢O Leo "Leontokardos" Kharntphilnt th' antallasse oles tou tis dunameis, olo to khrema kai te doxa pou apolambanei os enas apo tous koruphaious upereroes tes poles, gia ten agape tes sunadelphou tou, Antzela. Os ekhei, bgazei to akhti tou se autobiographika mini-komiks gia ton anekpleroto erota tou. Ola allazoun omos otan e Kassandra, mia epidoxe demiourgos enallaktikon komiks, tukhainei na ta diabasei...!
Mia istoria gemate agape, psemata kai komiks apo ton demiourgo tou Manifesto: Elia Kuriaze
"Asteio, sugkinetiko kai gemato optika purotekhnemata"
Mike Carey (X-MEN Legacy)
"Einai toso metamonterno pou einai panemorpho kai toso gluko pou ponaei"
Becky Cloonan (Demo)"ß
§They told John Lampart that he would have to have his entire bodily metabolism altered to survive on Argent.
Because that unknown planet was his most valuable find, he agreed.
He landed on Argent, golden-skinned and different. He had expected to find himself on a barren world, destined for two years of hard work. But Argent had life of its own of a different kind, weird, wild and endlessly challenging.
Not the least challenge to him was the discovery that his Earthly bosses regarded him as expendable - his work would end in his death while they got rich.
KING OF ARGENT is a novel of a man against a fantastically strange planet - and of the girl who dared to intervene."´
®"'Buffalo!' The old horseman struggled to his feet and boldly began his toast with glass held high, his weather-worn visage conspicuous in the room full of young men. Then 'BUFFALO, ' this time more quietly. Then, after a long pause, 'buffalo, ' almost in a whisper..." Thus Garrett Wilson introduces his epic account of the 1870s, a decade that saw unprecedented changes come to the Great Plains of North America: famine, fire, and pestilence--the disappearance of the buffalo--the last stand of the Sioux and the Metis--the Boundary Survey and the "March West" of the North-West Mounted Police--men like Dumont, Walsh, Macleod, and Sitting Bull--all encompassed within a brief 10 years, which saw the disappearance of the Old West, and the birth of a new society. Told with wit, sensitivity, and panache, Frontier Farewell explodes old myths and brings new perspectives to this pivotal era in the development of the North American Wes"µ	
≤	O KOKKINOS ARES einai to koruphaio ergo enos apo tous semantikoterous sugkhronous Amerikanous suggrapheis. O Kim Stanleu Rompinson demiourgese ena muthistorema epistemonikes phantasias sta oria tou "pithanou", khresimopoiontas ola ta teleutaia dedomena tes tekhnologias kai epistemonikes idees pou theoretika einai ephiktes.
To basiko plaisio tou ergou sterizetai ston apoikismo tou Are. Mia omada apo ekato epistemones, epilegmenous me austera kriteria epistemonikes katartises alla kai "politikes orthotetos" kataphthanoun ston Are. Mono pou o Ares einai e megale proklese gia te rexe me ta katestemena geina protupa kai te demiourgia mias alles koinonikes organoses kai enos allou tropou zoes kai axion. Kai e pleiopsephia ton anthropon pou pegan ekei etan arketa ikanoi na xegelasoun tis epitropes axiologeses gia tis bathuteres skepseis tous...
O Rompinson khresimopoiei mia muthoplasia bathutata sunarpastike gia na katagrapsei ta anthropina pathe, ton erota, tis parametrous tes politikes kai tes exousias, ton antagonismo kai telos te rexe, ten epanastase. E matia tou einai exairetika dieisdutike sten anthropine psukhologia kai bathutata stokhastike ste skhese tou anthropou me to periballon."∂
≥The Michael Moorcock Collection presents for the first time definitive editions of Moorcock's most influential work, fully revised and updated by the author.
Feared by enemies and friends alike, Elric of Melnibone walks a lonely path among the worlds of the multiverse. The destroyer of his own cruel and ancient race, as well as its final ruler, Elric is the bearer of a destiny as dark and cursed as the vampiric sword he carries - the sentient black blade known as Stormbringer.
With an introduction and a short story by Neil Gaiman, and containing complete novels as well as associated short stories, this collection presents Moorcock's greatest creation in a revised and approved order."∑
¥To 18o aiona o politismos den paragetai pleon sta monasteria, alla stis agroikies kai stis exokhes. E peripheme agroikia tou Goethe, ta topia tou Turner kai tou Constable, e aisthesiake rembe tou Rousseau, o Melanas Drumos, den einai para semeia mias olikes kai skhedon amzikes embathunses ste phuse, mia methexe sto topio pou emelle na einai kai e teleutaia istorika. To romantiko protupo tes agroikias, "to katoikein ton khorikon" opos tha to pei o Heidegger, einai kai to teleutaio ikhnos mias arkhaias antilepses gia ten katoikese pou erkhontai na anatrepsoun ek bathron oi neoi kairoi. Ena arkhaio katoiko pou stoikheionei omos akoma to phantasiako mas. E oikogeneia Eagles, ta dentrospita, e kataskenose ste phuse, ta paidia ton diamerismaton pou sunekhizoun stis ikhnographies tous na skhediazoun kalubes me xulinous phrakhtes, otan tous zeteitai na skhediasoun to spiti tous, marturoun mian aletheia pou deikhnei na antisteketai sthenara. Mia morphike antokhe pano sto anaglupho mias psukhikes anamneses pou sageneuei ama te emphanisei tou. Ta kephalaia tou bibliou diereunoun diaphoretikes ptukhes autou pou tha mporouse na onomastei eterotopia, e akoma kalutera etero(ou)topia, tes kalubas. Ap'ten kaluba tou Heidegger, Pou meteorizetai metaxu ouranou kai ges, kai tis krupsones tou Bachelard eos ten apolute diasaleuse tou rematos katoiko ton anakhoreton Pateron, e kaluba phantazei os to arkhegono kataphugio gia to kheimazomeno "einai". Ena katoiko pou kaleitai na stegasei authentika ten anestioteta tou anthropou, alla kai na proetoimasei kai ten adunate dexiose tou Allou."ª
∏Oi kairoi ekhoun allaxei.
Kapote to krataio okhuro tou Ntros Ntelnokh esteke aportheto. O Ntras o Thrulos, o tranos eroas ton Ntrenai, to uperaspizotan.
Tora omos enas paraphron turannos ekhei kataktesei to phrourio. Te diestrammene exousia tou sterizoun ta Ubridia, bdelura plasmata pou einai misa anthropoi kai misa ktene.
Enas antras, gonos orkismenon ekhthron, aphou stis phlebes tou kulaei to aima ton Nadir kai ton Ntrenai, analambanei na ektopisei ton turanno. Einai enas pareisaktos, periphronemenos ki apo tis duo pleures gia te diple katagoge tou. Enas antras antimetopos me tis straties tou Khaous.
O Tenaka Khan, o Prigkipas ton Skion.
Mia khouphta eroes apophasizei na ton akolouthesei s' aute ten tolmere apostole tou. Omos to na ton empisteutoun semaine pos tha empisteuontan kai ton proaionio ekhthro tous..."ø
ºGia ten nea ekdose deite 
Enas agnostos planetes ekhei apoikisthei apo Indous phugades. Mia omada apo autous, me te boetheia upseles tekhnologias, emphanizontai os ensarkoseis tou indouistikou pantheou, epiballontas stous upoloipous ena theokratiko kathestos. E ploke tou muthou thumizei entona to indiko epos. O Brakhma, o Bisnou, e Kali, to muthiko pteno Gkarouna, akome kai o idios o Boudas protagonistoun sto ergo, tou opoiou o kentrikos axonas einai e aionia exegerse tou anthropou, enantion enos akardou kai antianthropinou Ouranou. <>(1967) isos einai to kalutero muthistorema tou Rotzer Zelazni, mias apo tes egetikes phusiognomies tou amerikanikou neou kumatos, kai ton kataxiose sto koino."À
»Twenty subtugs had been lost attempting to bring back oil from the undersea fields on the enemy's borders. A brilliant psychologist-electronics expert is planted in the crew of the subtug Ram to discover the reason. And the reason becomes terrifying reality when, miles deep in the ocean, the minds of the crew begin to crack..."÷	
”	O Khari Ntresnten einai o kaluteros sto eidos tou. Edo pou ta leme, einai o monadikos. Etsi, otan e astunomia tou Sikago brisketai antimetope me mia upothese pou xepernaei tis anthropines dunatotetes, erkhetai s' auton psakhnontas apanteseis. Giati o "kathemerinos" kosmos einai sten pragmatikoteta gematos me paraxena kai uperphusika plasmata - ta perissotera ap' ta opoia den ta pane kai polu kala me tous anthropous. Edo einai pou mpainei sto paikhnidi o Khari. Khreiazetai enas magos gia na sullabei ena... telos panton, o,ti ki an einai auto.
Bebaia uparkhei ena mikro problema. Oi douleies - ki auto einai mia metriopathes ektimese - pane kata diaolou. Etsi, otan e astunomia zetaei te sundrome tou se mia upothese diplou phonou me maure mageia, o Khari blepei mia eukairia na anakampsei. Alla, opou uparkhei maure mageia, panta apo piso karadokei mia skoteine dianoia. Kai tora aute e dianoia gnorizei to onoma tou Khari. Ap' auto to semeio einai pou ta pragmata arkhizoun na ginontai... endiapheronta.
O Khari Ntresnten de khreiazetai idiaiteres sustaseis. Ta biblia me tis peripeteies tou ekhoun poulesei ekatommuria antitupa pagkosmios, kai e omonume seira tou SciFi Channel theoreitai apo tis pio epitukhemenes sten Amerike."€
ÿO Dr. Entouarnt Liouis Goueilant einai enas euupoleptos kathegetes Anthropologias sto Niou Mexiko me musteriode proeleuse, pou prospathei me kathe tropo na krupsei apo ton koinoniko periguro tou te bampirike tou phuse, e opoia pegazei apo mia entone biologike anagke. Einai o monadikos tou eidous tou kai zei anamesa stous phusiologikous anthropous, apomuzontas tous sunethos dikhos na to suneidetopoioun, epibionontas me duskolia se enan periploko kosmo opou opou den prepei na ginei antileptos...
Ena paraxeno kai prototupo skoteino muthistorema me polles anagnoseis -sunarpastike istoria tromou alla kai parabole pano sten anthropine phuse kai tis koinonikes skheseis- me enan eroa akros realistiko, makria apo ta stereotupa tou eidous, to opoio theoreitai apo pollous sugkhronous kritikous to artiotero monterno ergo pano ste thematike tou bampirismou."„
‡O Giannes Mpenakes, gnostos stous philous os "Mpen", einai proen astunomikos pou pleon bgazei ta pros to zen paristanontas ton idiotiko ntetektib -me paranomes mikrodouleies gia gnostous- eno pernaei ton upoloipo kairo tou erototropontas me neares kopeles kai pinontas me duo aprosmenous philous: enan alkooliko mpougatsatze kai enan paranoiko kathegete agglikon. E kainourgia douleia pou analambanei o Mpen apodeiknuetai polu pio apaitetike ap o,ti perimene arkhika, kathos sundeetai musteriodos me ton phainomenika tukhaio thanato mias apo tis proen kopeles tou, tes Mariannas Koutzabasile, kai odegei se mia mplegmene upothese e opoia skhetizetai me te skiere pleura tou phoitetikou sundikalismou kai me akome megalutera sumpheronta."Ë
Â<>.
Gia ten anthropoteta pou asphuktia kato ap' tis diktatories, aimorragei ap' tous polemous, xepsukha sta mise, o Almper Kamu ekhei te dike tou idea: para to pepromeno ki enantia sto paralogo, o anthropos einai to monadiko noema tou kosmou mas, giati einai to mono plasma pou apaitei na ekhei noema. Opos s' ola ta erga tou, etsi kai sto "Kalokairi", o Kamu sunekhizei na psakhnei gia to pio anagkaio ste zoe: to phos, ten eutukhia. (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"Ó
ÎOi perastikoi ton koitazoun me periergeia, tou khamogelane gluka, kapoies gunaikes kanoun truphera neumata me to kephali. Ti omorpho: enas sarantares andras pou ton sugkinei e mathetike parelase tes 28es Oktobriou sto kentro tes poles."Ô
ÏO khaliphes Batek, eggonos tou Kharoun el Rasint, ginetai uperetes tou Diabolou, parasurmenos apo ten akoreste periergeia tou kai te megalomania tou. Epeita apo te thusia penenta mikron paidion, tha xekinesei apo ten proteuousa tou, te Samara, gia ten ereipomene pole tou Istakhar, opou perimenei na dei tous thesaurous ton soultanon pou ezesan prin apo ton Adam. Epeita apo ametretes peripeteies, tha mpei sta upogeia domata tou Diabolou-Eblis, opou th' anakalupsei te mataioteta tou ploutou kai ton thaumaton pou th' antikrisei. Ekei, ton perimenei e timoria gia ten periergeia tou: ta aionia basanisteria sten kolase."¯
ıE ThEORIA TOU WINE BAR einai enas tropos antimetopises alla kai proseggises tes douleias.
Prolambanei kai katargei ten anapotelesmatikoteta - kai de khreiazetai na ekhei kapoios epikheirematikes gnoseis gia na to diabasei.
Boethontas sas na entopisete ta pragmata pou mporeite na kanete kalutera alla ki ekeina pou de khreiazetai na kanete katholou, oi 28 kanones tes Theorias tou Wine Bar, diatupomenoi khoris periploke orologia, tha sas exoikonomesoun khrono.
Kai ton khrono auto mporeite na ton axiopoiesete pinontas ena poteri krasi me tous philous sas se ena wine bar.
De sas aresei na pegainete se wine bar; Kanena problema!
Mporeite na paixete mpala, na plexete ena poulober e na pate gia psarema.
E aplos na dosete ston eauto sas khrono na skephtei."˛
˚O tomos periekhei tis istories:
1. Kh.Ph. Labkrapht - E phrike sto Rent Khouk
2. Rompert Khaouarnt - To plasma ste stege
3. Klark Aston Smith - E epistrophe tou magou
4. Rompert Mplak - O episkeptes apo t' astra
5. Tzon Ramsu Kampel - E phrike apo te gephura
6. Arthour Makhen - E noubela tes maures sphragidas
7. Tom T. Raimer - Ta prasina nera
8. Mpraian Lamlu - E adelphe pole"˛	
˚	O Enniadakhtulos Logken ekhei pia dunameis mono gia mia makhe - mia makhe omos pou de tha ekhei proegoumeno. O Basilias tou Borra paramenei paniskhuros kai uparkhei mono enas antras pou mporei na ton stamatesei: o palioteros philos tou kai palioteros ekhthros tou. Einai pia kairos o Aimoboros na epistrepsei sten patrida. O Egoumenos Gklokta dinei te dike tou mustike makhe enantia sto khrono kai tous pollous tou aphentes, opou kaneis den einai asphales kai kanenas den einai axios empistosunes. O Basilias tes Enoses aphenei ten teleutaia tou pnoe, oi khorikoi epanastatoun kai oi eugeneis erizoun gia te diadokhe. Alla kaneis de phantazetai pos e skia tou polemou tha skepasei ten kardia tes idias tes Enoses. Mono o Protos ton Magon ekhei ena skhedio gia na sosei ton kosmo... ena mallon ripsokinduno skhedio. Giati ti einai pio epikinduno apo to na parabei kaneis ton Proto Nomo;
"To kalutero deigma sugkhrones logotekhnias tou phantastikou."
("SFX")
"Uparkhei mia agrioteta ston kosmo tou kai mia epignose tou kostous tes bias pou einai exairetika sugkhrone."
("The Times")
"O Abercrombie ekhei grapsei ten kalutere trilogia phantasias ton teleutaion eton. Einai enas suggrapheas pou den prepei na khasete."
(Junot Diaz, timemenos me to Brabeio Poulitzer Logotekhnias)"␀␀P@"␀␀à@"	
